  "authors": [],
  "body": {
    "comment": "EMURGO as a DRep votes ABSTAIN on Cardano Global Events 2027: Treasury Withdrawal of 24,995,775 ada, with rationale outlined below.\n\nWith EMURGO scheduled to retire its DRep towards the end of December 2026, our primary governance duty during this final transition window is an orderly wind-down of our voting mandate to leave the determination of this 2027 expenditure to continuing DReps and active delegator representation."
  },
  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256"
}